电压未用仪器实测。", "cold_jtag": "用户明确表示已换成 JTAG 模式；本次真实读回 BootMode=0，CPU0/1 起初在 BootROM 停驻区运行，停核后 PC 分别为 FFFFFF28/FFFFFF34，OCM_CFG=0x18。前次 BootMode=1 且 CPU0=00102030，本次锁存启动模式及 PC 均变化；据此判断已经重新启动到 JTAG BootROM 停驻状态。具体断电/上电时刻未测。照片旧跳帽不替代本次实物寄存器。", "exclusive_writers": "本次 JTAG BootROM 停驻期间未下载任何应用/位流，两个 ARM 核已停止；本任务服务 PID39576/父37840 独占本机3121。本机进程清单未发现其他 Vivado/Vitis/XSDB/XSCT 控制者；清单中临时 pwsh 为清单采集本身。本轮 root 为唯一硬件控制者，子代理只读静态文件。按该启动状态判断没有启动旧 Linux/FSBL/PL/DMA writer，后续仍须再次检查目标/停核及服务/串口身份。"}, "live_state_binding": {"path": "report/evidence/S2B-T06/ps_jtag_retry_20261009_120653_r01/ps_state_result.json", "sha256": "072b9f65d10da992300532f2873c3a8b843e2f24cf270b4789e00155d0b014e6", "readback_at_utc8": "2026-10-09T12:13:26.513349+08:00"}, "reason": "用户提供完整 AX7020 照片后，root 核对已验收板卡身份、厂商 V2.2 的器件布局及14/15/17/18/26页，确认固定 PS-only 候选与本板资料对应，适用于当前受控检查；六项确认只覆盖上述有来源的工程判断，不能当成仪器测量、实际 DDR 丝印证明或功能通过。冷 JTAG 和独占条件采用用户当前操作及真实读回证据，执行前由 runner 再核验。本次不改写用户已明确确认的 XC7Z020-2 目标决策。"}, "target_properties": {"JTAG-jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081-4ba00477-0": {"target_id": 1, "target_ctx": "JTAG-jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081-4ba00477-0", "level": 0, "name": "APU", "parent_ctx": "", "parent": "", "state_reason": "", "is_current": 0, "bscan": "", "jtag_device_id": 2, "jtag_device_ctx": "jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081-4ba00477-0", "jtag_device_index": 0, "jtag_device_name": "arm_dap", "jtag_cable_id": 1, "jtag_cable_ctx": "jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081", "jtag_cable_name": "Digilent JTAG-HS1 210512180081", "jtag_cable_manufacturer": "Digilent", "jtag_cable_product": "JTAG-HS1", "jtag_cable_serial": "210512180081"}, "JTAG-jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081-4ba00477-0.0": {"target_id": 2, "target_ctx": "JTAG-jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081-4ba00477-0.0", "level": 1, "name": "ARM Cortex-A9 MPCore #0", "parent_ctx": "JTAG-jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081-4ba00477-0", "parent": "APU", "state_reason": "Running", "is_current": 0, "bscan": "", "jtag_device_id": 2, "jtag_device_ctx": "jsn-JTAG-HS1-210512180081-4ba00477-0", "jtag_device_index": 0, "jtag_device_n